Package: quantsmind-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libegl1, libxkbcommon0, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libglib2.0-0
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: QuantsMind <support@quantsmind.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/quantsmind-ai/QuantsMind-Agent
Description: A local coding agent for your own project folders
 QuantsMind-Agent is a desktop application that reads, explains and edits code in
 a project folder you open, and runs commands there when you approve it. It runs
 entirely on your machine. The application itself carries no licence fee and
 embeds no API key: cloud model usage is billed by your own provider against
 your own account, and a local model can be used instead where one is available.
 .
 This package installs the application under /opt/quantsmind-agent. Your
 configuration, credentials, logs and conversation history are kept in
 $XDG_DATA_HOME and $XDG_CONFIG_HOME and are never touched by installation,
 upgrade or removal.